<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>GEODE Self-Improving Hub</title>
<meta name="description" content="Discovery surface for GEODE's autonomous self-improvement loop — Petri audits, seed-generation runs, autoresearch baseline + mutations.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/geode/self-improving/assets/hub.css">
<script src="/geode/self-improving/assets/hub.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

<div class="shell">

  {{ hub_nav }}

  <main class="content" id="main">
    <h1 class="page-title">GEODE Self-Improving Hub</h1>
    <p class="page-sub">Anthropic Petri (inspect_ai) audit, self-improving-loop seed-generation, and autoresearch closed-loop. Three surfaces, one publish bundle. Each row shows the recorded model and execution source (PAYG = API key, Legacy Claude CLI = historical receipt, ChatGPT = subscription OAuth, GEODE = self-target wrapper).</p>

{{ stale_baseline_warning }}

    <section class="hub-orient" aria-labelledby="in-this-hub" data-page-map>
      <h2 class="section" id="in-this-hub"><span>In this hub</span></h2>
      <ol class="orient-list">
        <li>
          <h3 class="orient-name"><a href="#petri-audit">Petri Audit</a> <span class="count">{{ petri_section_label }}</span></h3>
          <p>Recent inspect_ai audit archives with the recorded auditor, target and judge models. Each id opens its log in the viewer.</p>
          <p class="orient-go"><a href="/geode/self-improving/petri-bundle/">SPA log viewer <span aria-hidden="true">&#x2197;</span></a></p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3 class="orient-name"><a href="#seed-generation">Seed Generation</a> <span class="count">{{ seedgen_section_label }}</span></h3>
          <p>Seed-generation runs with drafted, surviving and evolved candidates and their usage.</p>
          <p class="orient-go"><a href="/geode/self-improving/seed-generation/">All runs</a></p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3 class="orient-name"><a href="#autoresearch">Autoresearch</a> <span class="count">baseline {{ autoresearch_status_label }}</span></h3>
          <p>Baseline, mutation ledger, results, evidence and run reports for the closed loop.</p>
          <p class="orient-go"><a href="/geode/self-improving/autoresearch/">Autoresearch overview</a></p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3 class="orient-name"><a href="#crucible">Crucible</a> <span class="count">{{ crucible_count_label }}</span></h3>
          <p>Per-attempt usage from the campaign ledgers. Totals are a metered floor.</p>
          <p class="orient-go"><a href="{{ crucible_kernel_source_url }}" rel="noopener">Kernel architecture (source) <span aria-hidden="true">&#x2197;</span></a> <a href="{{ crucible_docs_url }}">Bounded search (docs) <span aria-hidden="true">&#x2197;</span></a></p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <h2 class="section" id="petri-audit"><span>Petri Audit &middot; {{ petri_section_label }}</span></h2>
    <table class="records">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>id</th><th>seeds</th><th>auditor</th><th>target</th><th>judge</th><th>started</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
{{ petri_rows }}
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2 class="section" id="seed-generation"><span>Seed Generation &middot; {{ seedgen_section_label }}</span></h2>
    <table class="records">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>run_id</th><th>gen_tag</th><th>target_dim</th><th>harness</th><th>draft &rarr; surv &rarr; evolved</th><th>tokens &middot; cost</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
{{ seedgen_rows }}
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2 class="section" id="autoresearch"><span>Autoresearch &middot; baseline + mutation ledger</span></h2>
    <table class="records">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>artifact</th><th>last write</th><th>generation</th><th>auditor / target / judge models</th><th>fitness</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
{{ autoresearch_rows }}
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2 class="section" id="crucible"><span>Crucible &middot; campaign ledger &middot; {{ crucible_count_label }}</span></h2>
    <p class="muted">Per-attempt usage from the append-only campaign ledgers
      (<code>state/ledger.jsonl</code>). Totals are a metered floor: early attempts
      recorded tokens before pricing was wired, and a failed capture leaves an
      attempt with wall time but no usage.</p>
    <table class="records">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>campaign</th><th>outcome</th><th>tokens</th><th>cost</th><th>wall / flags</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
{{ crucible_rows }}
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2 class="section" id="documentation"><span>Documentation</span></h2>
    <table class="records">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>page</th><th>summary</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td class="id"><a href="/geode/docs/petri/overview">Petri Overview</a></td>
          <td class="muted">Petri framework + GEODE wrapper, 3 model roles</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="id"><a href="/geode/docs/petri/scenarios">Petri Scenarios</a></td>
          <td class="muted">22 GEODE-specific seeds across critical / auxiliary / info</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="id"><a href="/geode/docs/petri/run">Run an Audit</a></td>
          <td class="muted"><code>geode-eval audit</code> primary path + <code>inspect eval</code> raw</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="id"><a href="/geode/docs/petri/judge-dimensions">Judge Dimensions</a></td>
          <td class="muted">22 dim subset + 38 dim full set</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="id"><a href="/geode/docs/petri/seeds">Seed Dashboard</a></td>
          <td class="muted">per-run survivors + cost + meta-review (Next.js page)</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="build-info">
      <p>Source: <code>docs/self-improving/</code> (mirrors <code>docs/petri-bundle/</code> post-relocation, Phase 3).</p>
      <p>Published by <code>.github/workflows/pages.yml</code> on every <code>main</code> push.</p>
      <p>Repo: <a href="https://github.com/mangowhoiscloud/geode" rel="noopener">github.com/mangowhoiscloud/geode</a></p>
      <p>Harness chip legend:
        <span class="chip payg">PAYG</span>API key billing &middot;
        <span class="chip claude">Legacy Claude CLI</span>historical receipts &middot;
        <span class="chip codex">ChatGPT</span>ChatGPT subscription, Codex CLI OAuth &middot;
        <span class="chip geode">GEODE</span>self-target wrapper.
      </p>
      <p class="version-stamp">
        Rendered against GEODE <code>v{{ geode_version }}</code> &middot; DESIGN.md schema {{ design_schema_version }} &middot; built {{ build_date }}.
        Dim subset: 22 (geode_5axes). Pipeline phases: 8. Baseline schema: v2 (PR-2).
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>

</div>
</body>
</html>
